{'symbol': 'JNJ', 'date': '2021-07-15 13:32:00', 'title': 'JOHNSON & JOHNSON FACES CLASS-ACTION LAWSUIT OVER BENZENE-TAINTED NEUTROGENA AND AVEENO SUNSCREEN PRODUCTS', 'text': 'SAN FRANCISCO, JULY 15, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0PHARMACEUTICAL PRODUCT-SAFETY LAWYERS AT THE BEASLEY ALLEN LAW FIRM HAVE FILED A FEDERAL CLASS-ACTION LAWSUIT ON BEHALF OF CONSUMERS WHO BOUGHT RECALLED BENZENE-TAINTED SUNSCREEN PRODUCTS MADE BY JOHNSON & JOHNSON (NYSE: JNJ) SUBSIDIARIES NEUTROGENA AND AVEENO. THE LAWSUIT SEEKS AN INJUNCTION AND DAMAGES ON BEHALF OF CONSUMERS WHO PURCHASED A RANGE OF NEUTROGENA AND AVEENO SUN-CARE PRODUCTS.'}